OL,3,GNEWSAPub team wins #10,000 in Ultimate
OL,4,APool final
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pool team from Keighley has won the
OL,7,FUltimate Pool League final, beating 200
OL,8,Fteams to the #10,000 prize.
OL,10,FBreaking Bad from Pilky's Cue Sports
OL,11,FClub and Bar beat Leicester's Rail
OL,12,FHuggers 25-19 it the final at the Cue
OL,13,FClub, in Leicester, on Monday, just
OL,14,Ffour months after they were formed.
OL,16,F"It was an unbelievable night for the
OL,17,Fclub and the team," said Pilky's
OL,18,Fmanager Ryan Stewart, who said the team
OL,19,Fhad "outdone all our expectations".
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
